{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46648","headline":"荆州新秋病起杂题一十五首 病起见庭竹 · 齐己","name":"荆州新秋病起杂题一十五首 病起见庭竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病起见庭竹，君应悲我情。\n何妨甚消瘦，却称苦修行。\n每谢侵牀影，时回傍枕声。\n秋来渐平复，吟遶骨毛轻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46648.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46648","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}